.TH ifg-wiki 1  "ifg-wiki 0.9.0"
.SH NAME
ifg\-wiki \- Read and manage repository Wiki pages
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBifg wiki\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read and manage repository Wiki pages
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
ifg\-wiki\-list(1)
List Wiki pages
.TP
ifg\-wiki\-view(1)
Read a page
.TP
ifg\-wiki\-create(1)
Create a page from text or a UTF\-8 file (use \- for stdin)
.TP
ifg\-wiki\-edit(1)
Replace a page\*(Aqs content
.TP
ifg\-wiki\-history(1)
List previous revisions
.TP
ifg\-wiki\-delete(1)
Delete a page after confirmation
.TP
ifg\-wiki\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v0.9.0
